Why this actually fixes it

touch-action: none on the card tells the browser: do not treat this gesture as a pan/scroll. Now your pointer events remain “yours”.

The scroll container still scrolls normally when the gesture starts on non-card space (touch-pan-y).

The hook becomes simpler and faster: no timers, no racing the browser.



